  "organization": null,
  "title": "Wynncraft 101",
  "description": "A simple modpack for Wynncraft.",
  "body": "<br>\n<center>    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jWVDLzC.png\" alt=\"<b>🗡️ Wynncraft 101 🏹</b>\"></center>\n<br>\n<center>A Simple modpack for playing <b><a href=\"https://wynncraft.com/\">Wynncraft</a></b>.</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/2eac7d45a7a9556c4dbabe6d6f60ce18087983c0.png\" alt=\"img1\" width=\"459\" height=\"270\">\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/d8a59e63dca7c2ea8d12229d3174bc577544d672.png\" alt=\"img2\" width=\"459\" height=\"270\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><b>Class Selection</b></center></td>\n<td><center><b>Better third person</b></center></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/29916a8aaa14dc01b3e689ac5db74447e944baa6.png\" alt=\"img1\" width=\"459\" height=\"270\">\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/7eb2cb9cf2afb12c2c0f0ed3602ac12fe0e2faf8.png\" alt=\"img2\" width=\"459\" height=\"270\">\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><b>Custom Questbook</b></center></td>\n<td><center><b>In-game map</b></center></td></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n# Description\n\n<p>This modpack's main goal is to provide a simple/streamlined experience for wynncraft. Only the most important (In my opinion) mods are included.</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/402d8eea4abae00c5c6d3ba6ae77033da8cf9333.png\" alt=\"Performance Comparison\">\n<center><b>Performance Comparison</b></center>\n\n\n# Features:\n\n- Minimap, Better Contentbook and many other quality of life tweaks thanks to **Wynntils**\n- Full voice acting with **Voices of Wynn**\n- Shaderpack support with **Complementary Shaders - Unbound** preinstalled \n- Custom Wynncraft themed Main Menu\n- Better third person mode with **Shoulder Surfing Reloaded**\n- Big performance boost ([Performance comparison](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/402d8eea4abae00c5c6d3ba6ae77033da8cf9333.png))\n- Zoom by pressing **C** \n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>All induced mods: 1.21</summary>\n\n- [Cloth Config v17](https://modrinth.com/mod/9s6osm5g)\n- [Cubes Without Borders](https://modrinth.com/mod/ETlrkaYF)\n- [Drippy Loading Screen](https://modrinth.com/mod/v3CYg2V9)\n- [EntityCulling](https://modrinth.com/mod/NNAgCjsB)\n- [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/P7dR8mSH)\n- [Fabric Language Kotlin](https://modrinth.com/mod/Ha28R6CL)\n- [FancyMenu](https://modrinth.com/mod/Wq5SjeWM)\n- [Forge Config API Port](https://modrinth.com/mod/ohNO6lps)\n- [ImmediatelyFast](https://modrinth.com/mod/5ZwdcRci)\n- [Iris](https://modrinth.com/mod/YL57xq9U)\n- [Konkrete](https://modrinth.com/mod/J81TRJWm)\n- [Lithium](https://modrinth.com/mod/gvQqBUqZ)\n- [Loader](https://modrinth.com/mod/EMQzFaJ1)\n- [Melody](https://modrinth.com/mod/CVT4pFB2)\n- [ModernFix](https://modrinth.com/mod/nmDcB62a)\n- [No Telemetry](https://modrinth.com/mod/hg77g4Pw)\n- [Ok Zoomer](https://modrinth.com/mod/aXf2OSFU)\n- [Shoulder Surfing Reloaded](https://modrinth.com/mod/kepjj2sy)\n- [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/AANobbMI)\n- [Voices of Wynn](https://modrinth.com/mod/Hn8Ot3qH)\n- [Wynntils](https://modrinth.com/mod/dU5Gb9Ab)\n- [Wynntils](https://wynntils.com)\n- [Wynntils](https://wynntils.com)\n- [YOSBR](https://modrinth.com/mod/WwbubTsV)\n\n</details>\n\n<hr>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yvC0d6Q6/images/0434a081962e6781e28c5e5769ed51de39b75b6c.png\" alt=\"Epic screenshot of the Main Menu\" >\n<br>\n<br>\n<center><b>Epic screenshot of the Main Menu</b></center>\n<hr>\n\n<center><p> If you are interested in a modpack with more features I recommend you to check out <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/wynnicenchantments\">Wynnic Enchantments by Rafii</a></p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/wynnicenchantments\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WMjBYFp1/images/b63972272f5dc7f3b12f10427acce7d4e45623f4.png\" alt=\"img1\" width=\"459\" height=\"270\"></a></center>\n<hr>\n\n# Disclaimer\n\n<center>This modpack is fan made! Unaffiliated with Mojang or Wynncraft<center>\n",
